  "intended_behavior": "Change ONLY v2 Entity.entity_id from string to bytes. Text identifiers use UTF-8 encode on construction and UTF-8 decode for observations. v1 string identifiers and all v1 relay behavior remain unchanged. Preserve the existing standalone sample identifiers in each runtime. For valid UTF-8, empty/Unicode/escaped text must round trip identically. Arbitrary non-UTF-8 bytes and mixed-version interoperability are outside this case; do not invent conversions. The output observation key remains entity_id with a string value. Keep version selection explicit. Never change tests or generated bindings. All three subscribers must independently decode both schema-version topics. Pub/sub is in-memory and local.",
